flowchart LR
  Stop[Stop app and acquire maintenance lock] --> Stage[Stage new credential generation]
  Stage --> Validate[Verify keys, chains, expiry, permissions]
  Validate --> Swap[Atomic generation pointer swap]
  Swap --> App[Restart app]
  DB[(Unchanged state.db and receipts)] --> App
  Token[Independent token generation] --> Swap
  Old[Bounded previous generation] --> Rollback[Rollback if restart fails]
